            "notes": "For this first round, we start out just like most other Zenyatta builds do:\n\nInner Peace gives you tons of sustain (and farms Stadium Cash fast)\n\nWeapon Power and Attack Speed amplify your baseline output \u2014 Zen doing Zen things\n\nA little bonus armor for early survivability\n\nThe goal of Round 1 is simple: farm cash.\n\nBut don\u2019t zone out \u2014 this is also your scouting phase.\nAsk yourself:\n\nAre you constantly getting cornered?\n\nIs the enemy pushing into you with no space to kite?\n\nAre you getting pressured hard and dying early?\n\nIf the answer is yes, you may need to pivot.\nBe ready \u2014 because you might need to take a hard turn into Brawl Zen later in the match.",
