            "notes": "\ud83d\udcb0 Round 2 Strategy\n\nIn Round 2, the core strategy remains the same:\n\nStay alive\n\nApply Discord and Harmony\n\nFarm cash\n\nPlay standard Zenyatta \u2014 positioning, poke, and pressure\n\nNothing flashy \u2014 just clean, fundamental Zen gameplay. You're still in default mode, but laying the groundwork for a possible transition.\n\n\ud83d\udd27 Must-Buy Mods\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Talon Mod\n\u2003\u2022 Massive DPS boost\n\n\ud83d\udc89 Advanced Nanobiotics\n\u2003\u2022 One of the highest raw DPS upgrades in the game, in terms of bang for your buck\n\u2003\u2022 Pairs perfectly with Inner Peace.  Every time you take damage, you attack faster\n\nTogether, Talon + Nanobiotics is mathematically the most damage you can output at this stage. These two are non-negotiable.\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Optional Upgrades (if you have cash)\n\n\u2699\ufe0f Crusader Hydraulics\n\u2003\u2022 Great early armor and damage reduction\n\u2003\u2022 If you do pivot into tank Zen later in the game, this ability will be with you all 7 \n      rounds\n\n\ud83e\udde5 Armored Vest + \ud83e\ude79 First Aid Kit\n\u2003\u2022 Fine substitutes if you\u2019re short on cash\n\nRound 2 is still Zenyatta Classic, but it's also the tipping point.\nIf you're getting dove, pressured, or your team is collapsing \u2014 keep your pivot in mind. The monk becomes the brawler very quickly.",
