            "notes": "\ud83e\uddf1 Round 3: The Pivot Point\n\nThis round is your first real opportunity to transition into Tank Zen, if you've been farming well and stacking cash.\n\n\ud83d\uded1 TANK ZEN THRESHOLD: 24,500 CASH\n\nTo fully become Tank Zen, you must have:\n\nEnlightenment\n\nGolden Monk\n\nGloomgauntlet\n\nCrusader Hydraulics\n\nIf you don\u2019t have 24.5k by this round, don\u2019t force it \u2014 stick with Default WP/AS Zen and use the optional items below to stay efficient.\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f TANK ZEN BUILD (Required Items)\n\n\u2728Instant Karma\n\nAfter the Enlightenment change to no longer heal yourself, it\u2019s not really worth taking.  The extra healing for your tank is nice, but we will fix that in round 5.  This power is to replace your own sustain that Enlightenment used to give you.  Try to leave discord on whoever is shooting at you and you will be extremely hard to kill.\n\n\ud83e\udd4b Golden Monk\n\u2003\u2022 +5% melee damage per 50 armor\n\u2003\u2022 You now have 125 armor \u2014 that\u2019s +10% melee\n\n\ud83e\uddb4 Gloomgauntlet\n\u2003\u2022 +15% melee damage\n\u2003\u2022 Heals 2.5% of max HP/sec (~10 HP/sec at this stage)\n\u2003\u2022 Sustain engine that lets you frontline without fear\n\nTotal Melee Buffs:\n\n15% (Gloomgauntlet)\n\n10% (Golden Monk at 125 armor)\n\n25% (Discord Orb)\n\u2003\u2192 That\u2019s a 50% bonus kick before armor damage scaling. Big kicks.\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Default Path (If under 24.5k)\n\nStick with WP/AS Zen. Recommended items:\n\nHaste Subroutine - one of my favorite items for Zen.  Makes your orbs almost be hitscan.  It will be much harder to miss.\n\nTalon Mod - pure WP increase\n\nCrusader Hydraulics \u2014 same thing as before.  Gives you less damage taken, which lets you stay in the fight.\n\nThis path is totally valid if you're not feeling the pressure yet \u2014 but keep an eye on how fights are playing out.\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Tank Zen Playstyle Tips\n\nYou are now frontlining with your tank \u2014 no more backline squishiness\n\nKick constantly to:\n\u2003\u2022 Trigger Gloomgauntlet healing\n\u2003\u2022 Knockback the target to throw off aim and cooldowns\n\u2003\u2022 Maximize melee damage pressure\n\nFight rhythm:\n\u2003\u2192 Discord \u2192 Shoot \u2192 Kick \u2192 Shoot \u2192 Kick \u2192 Shoot\u2026 until they drop\n\nAlways be in the fray \u2014 don\u2019t backpedal. Your value scales with uptime.\n\nNEVER. STOP. KICKING.",
