            "notes": "\ud83e\uddf1 Round 4: Full Tank Zen Online\n\nBy now, if you\u2019re following this guide, you should be in full Tank Zen mode.\nBut remember \u2014 this build is not for everyone, or every game.\nIf you\u2019re not being pressured, if you\u2019re surviving fine, or if you're looking for poke/DPS optimization \u2014\nthis is NOT the build for you.\nThere are better options.\n\nBut if you\u2019re getting melted every fight, your team is feeding, or you\u2019re the only thing keeping the frontline afloat \u2014\nyou\u2019re exactly where you need to be.\n\n\ud83e\ude96 Core Upgrade: Vital-E-Tee\n+100 Armor (converts 100 base HP into armor)\n\n+10 bonus Armor\n\nTotal new armor: 235 Armor\n\nThat\u2019s +20% melee damage from Golden Monk now.\nAdd in:\n\n+15% from Gloomgauntlet\n\n+25% from Discord Orb\n\nYou\u2019re now swinging with +60% melee damage.\n\nYou are Jackie Chan.\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Optional Sustain Boost: Ogundimu Reduction Field\nAdds +50 more armor (up to 285 armor total)\n\nProvides damage reduction and flat healing over time\n\nGreat sustain tool that keeps you in fights longer\n\nAlso increases your Golden Monk bonus further (up to +25% melee)\n\nIf you\u2019ve got the cash, this is your next power spike.\n\n\ud83e\udd7e Playstyle Reminder\n\nYou are no longer a support. You are a melee bruiser.\n\nStay in melee range, cycling Discord on targets, and never stop kicking.\n\nMelee Rhythm:\n\u2003\u2192 Discord \u2192 Shoot \u2192 Kick \u2192 Shoot \u2192 Kick \u2192 Repeat\n\nYour self-healing, armor, and kick damage will do the rest.",
