            "notes": "\ud83e\uddf1 Round 5: The Final Form\n\nAt this point, if you've followed the guide, you're a walking fortress with absurd sustain, massive kick damage, and the ability to anchor your team in even the sloppiest of brawls.\n\nNow it\u2019s time to choose your power \u2014 and finalize the build.\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Round 5 Power\n\n\ud83d\udc50 Soul Control\n\nAfter the buffs, Soul Control has tremendous value in sustaining fights over time.  Unless you\u2019re responding to an enemy ult and need it for longer, never use Transcendence for longer than Zen\u2019s ult voiceline (ex. *ult* EXPERIENCE TRANQUILI- *end ult*).\n\n\ud83e\uddf1 Required Round 5 Item: Ogundimu Reduction Field\nNow a mandatory part of the core build\n\nGrants up to 10% damage reduction\n\nWhen combined with Crusader Hydraulics, gives you a full 20% DR\n\nAlso adds +50 Armor \u2192 boosts Golden Monk kick damage even further\n\n\ud83d\udc9a Your Sustain Snapshot (at 500+ HP / 285+ Armor)\nGloomgauntlet \u2192 ~13 HP/sec\n\nInner Peace \u2192 ~7.5 HP/sec\n\nInstant Karma \u2192 ~15% of damage taken/sec from Discorded attackers\n\nDamage Reduction \u2192 20% flat mitigation\n\nYou're healing from everything and mitigating more than most tanks.\nYou are a raid boss now.\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Playstyle: Brawl, Brawl, Brawl\n\nStick to your shoot \u2192 kick \u2192 shoot \u2192 kick rhythm\n\nStay in melee range\n\nLead pushes with your tank, disrupt the enemy backline when you can\n\nAlways be Discording, always be Kicking\n\nThe only way you die now is if you stop kicking.",
