            "notes": "\ud83e\uddf1 Round 6: Final Form \u2014 The Raid Boss Monk\n\nBy Round 6, the build is complete.\nYou are no longer a support. You are no longer human.\nYou are a golden, armored monk of death \u2014 and there is nothing more to add.\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Final Touch: Rustung Von Wilhelm\n+15 Armor\n\n+50 Base Health\n\nPushes you to ~600 Total HP and 300 Armor\n\nThis pushes your Golden Monk bonus to its final tier:\n\n+30% Melee Damage (from 300 Armor)\n\n+15% Gloomgauntlet Melee\n\n+25% Discord Bonus\n\n\ud83d\udca5 Kick Damage Math:\n\nBase Kick: ~87\n\nAfter Discord Orb: ~110 per kick\n\nThat\u2019s three or four kicks for a squishy, around ten for a tank. And that's not counting the normal shots you mix in between kicks.\nAnd you\u2019re healing the whole time.\n\n\ud83d\udc9a Sustain Snapshot (Final Build Totals)\n\n600 Health\n\n300 Armor\n\n15 HP/sec from Gloomgauntlet\n\n7.5 HP/sec from Inner Peace\n\n20% Damage Reduction (Crusader + Ogundimu)\n\n15% Healing from damage taken by Discorded targets (Instant Karma)\n\nTranscendence charges quickly \u2014 use it to reset or save your team\n\nYou are now functionally immortal in any fight you commit to correctly.\n\n\ud83e\uddd8 Gameplan: Transcendent Violence\n\nYour rhythm stays the same:\n\nDiscord \u2192 Shoot \u2192 Kick \u2192 Shoot \u2192 Kick \u2192 Repeat\nNever stop. Never back up. Never blink.\n\nBrawl next to your tank\n\nLead dives\n\nPunish overextensions\n\nEat CC and keep swinging\n\nUse Transcendence aggressively if needed\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 This is it. You are complete.\nThere is no next upgrade.\nYou\u2019ve built the strongest Zenyatta in the game for raw durability and melee burst.\nFrom support\u2026 to sustain bruiser\u2026 to endgame raid boss.\n\nKick. Shoot. Kick.\nAnd don\u2019t stop until you drop \u2014 or the enemy does.",
